{"unit_id":"fg-time__dsh-pp#card-zh","repo":"fg-time/dsh-pp","commit":"26993080e97a232f162788a35a6c704e7a40ff13","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-purge（DSH 插件，Web 与桌面客户端）：为 DeepSeek Harness 提供提示词与宿主补丁管理，并以会话标题旁的侧栏作为控制入口。插件会接入系统提示词和工具服务，提供补丁状态、应用与还原、规则集和 Skill 管理、会话回退及工作区门控。适合希望集中管理本机 Harness 行为与会话辅助功能的用户；需要已安装的官方 DSH，配置和补丁保存在本机，应用后需重启。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1-62","client.js:1-35","cordis.patch.yml:15-45"]}
{"unit_id":"fg-time__dsh-pp#card-en","repo":"fg-time/dsh-pp","commit":"26993080e97a232f162788a35a6c704e7a40ff13","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-purge is a DeepSeek Harness plugin for Web and desktop. Its session dock manages patch status, apply and restore, rule sets, Skills, and rewind. Workspace markers can gate prompt changes. It requires an installed official DSH client; settings are local and applying changes requires a restart.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1-62","client.js:1-35","cordis.patch.yml:15-45"]}
